      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Hi, is discord trying to run the overlay on VRChat? In the discord settings there is a list of games and options on if discord should overlay. It's on the page that has the shortcut to toggle the overlay.\n\nPersonally I have the overlay off, and never have trouble with discord in background when using VRChat.\n\nEdit: Went looking for it  today, and under Activity Settings \"Registered Games\". My VRChat has a Overlay disabled (last icon is red)",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
