      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "same here if discord is running i have to run launch.exe in admin mode for vrchat to launch if i instead turn off discord and first launch vrchat i do not need to run launch.exe in admin mode\n\n Update Turning off hardware acceleration in discord advanced settings  fixes this and lets vrchat launch like normal. Might this also be a AMD issue im running a 6900xt on latest drivers\n\nUpdate after toggling hardware acceleration off  and back on Vrchat now launches like normal  no matter the state of hw acc",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
