      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I will add that I have found a way to deal with this in my environment.\n\nI was able to prevent the problem of failed startup by setting Discord to not detect VRChat in the activity settings.\n\nI think the problem is caused by the update of Discord on Nov. 2, which made the EAC false detection, but I don't know the details.\n\n私の環境での対処方法が見つかったので追記します。\n\nDiscordのアクティビティ設定で、VRChatを検出しない様に設定する事で起動失敗する問題を防ぐことが出来ました。\n\nDiscordの11/2のアップデートでEACが誤検知する様になった事が原因に思えますが、詳細は不明です。",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
